{
  "info": {
    "name": "Bache 0 · Hito 2 · Demostración CRUD (breve)",
    "description": "Demostración de 4 peticiones por recurso (crear, leer, actualizar, borrar) con persistencia confirmada.\n\nPrerrequisitos: API en http://localhost:3000, base creada con db/schema.sql y db/seed.sql, superadministrador creado por SEED_SUPERADMIN_*. Los IDs de municipalidad corresponden al seed actual (1 Estación Central, 2 La Pintana, 3 El Bosque, 4 Providencia sin servicio).\n\nCrea solo datos ficticios que la propia colección desactiva o archiva. Ejecútala preferiblemente sobre una base aislada (p. ej. bache0_profesor). La foto se adjunta manualmente desde el repositorio: selecciónala en 2.1 antes de enviar. Ejecútala en orden.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0 · Login superadmin",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "auth",
            "login"
          ]
        },
        "auth": {
          "type": "noauth"
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{superadmin_email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{superadmin_password}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "description": "Define superadmin_email y superadmin_password en las variables de la colección (los mismos SEED_SUPERADMIN_* de tu backend/.env). No subas credenciales reales."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test(\"Guarda el token\", () => { const t = pm.response.json().data.access_token; pm.expect(t).to.be.a(\"string\"); pm.collectionVariables.set(\"superadmin_token\", t); });"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1 · Usuarios municipales (CRUD)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1.1 · Crear inspector (201)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/usuarios",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "usuarios"
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{superadmin_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Inspector Demo {{run_id}}\",\n  \"email\": \"inspector.demo.{{run_id}}@example.test\",\n  \"password\": \"{{demo_password}}\",\n  \"rol\": \"inspector\",\n  \"municipalidad_id\": {{municipalidad_id}}\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": ""
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"run_id\", String(Date.now()));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"demo_password\", \"Demo-\" + Date.now() + \"-xY\");"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 201\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const d = pm.response.json().data;",
                  "pm.test(\"Rol y municipalidad correctos\", () => { pm.expect(d.rol).to.eql(\"inspector\"); pm.expect(String(d.municipalidad_id)).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get(\"municipalidad_id\")); });",
                  "pm.test(\"No expone password ni hash\", () => { pm.expect(JSON.stringify(d)).to.not.include(\"password\"); });",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"user_id\", String(d.id));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "1.2 · Leer la cuenta (200)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/usuarios/{{user_id}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "usuarios",
                "{{user_id}}"
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{superadmin_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": ""
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test(\"Es la cuenta creada\", () => pm.expect(String(pm.response.json().data.id)).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get(\"user_id\")));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "1.3 · Actualizar nombre (200)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/usuarios/{{user_id}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "usuarios",
                "{{user_id}}"
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{superadmin_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Inspector Demo (editado)\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": ""
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test(\"El nombre cambió\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.nombre).to.eql(\"Inspector Demo (editado)\"));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "1.4 · Desactivar la cuenta (204)",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/usuarios/{{user_id}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "usuarios",
                "{{user_id}}"
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{superadmin_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": ""
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 204\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(204));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "1.5 · Confirmar persistencia: activo=false (200)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/usuarios/{{user_id}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "usuarios",
                "{{user_id}}"
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{superadmin_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": ""
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test(\"La cuenta se conserva desactivada\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.activo).to.eql(false));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2 · Reportes (CRUD)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "2.1 · Crear reporte ciudadano (201)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/reportes",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "reportes"
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "latitud",
                  "type": "text",
                  "value": "-33.4602",
                  "description": ""
                },
                {
                  "key": "longitud",
                  "type": "text",
                  "value": "-70.6981",
                  "description": ""
                },
                {
                  "key": "metodo_ubicacion",
                  "type": "text",
                  "value": "pin_manual",
                  "description": ""
                },
                {
                  "key": "ubicacion_confirmada",
                  "type": "text",
                  "value": "true",
                  "description": ""
                },
                {
                  "key": "severidad",
                  "type": "text",
                  "value": "media",
                  "description": ""
                },
                {
                  "key": "concurrencia_vial",
                  "type": "text",
                  "value": "media",
                  "description": ""
                },
                {
                  "key": "infraestructura_critica",
                  "type": "text",
                  "value": "ninguna",
                  "description": ""
                },
                {
                  "key": "descripcion",
                  "type": "text",
                  "value": "PRUEBA POSTMAN BACHE0 - FICTICIO - NO ES UN REPORTE REAL",
                  "description": ""
                },
                {
                  "key": "foto",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": [],
                  "description": "Elegir manualmente backend/fixtures/seed-photos/demo-report-001.png (o cualquier JPEG/PNG/WebP de hasta 10 MB) antes de Send."
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Petición pública (sin token). Requiere internet: la comuna se resuelve con Nominatim. Elige la foto antes de enviar."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 201\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "pm.test(\"Cabecera Location\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get(\"Location\")).to.match(/\\/api\\/v1\\/reportes\\/\\d+$/));",
                  "const d = pm.response.json().data;",
                  "pm.test(\"Folio BA-AAAA-NNNNNN\", () => pm.expect(d.folio).to.match(/^BA-\\d{4}-\\d{6}$/));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"reporte_id\", String(d.id)); pm.collectionVariables.set(\"reporte_folio\", d.folio);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "2.2 · Leer el reporte (200)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/reportes/{{reporte_id}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "reportes",
